{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Require plants for sale to be labelled with animal toxicity information",
        "additional_details": "This petition is to support owners with pets and having flowers. As a pet owner I struggle to get flowers has I don't know which are safe, and I have friends come round and they bring me flowers and they have to be binned for not being safe. For people who don't have any pets this is something not many people think about although they also really love animals and then feel really guilty if anything happens. I think it's time owners should be able to confidently buy flowers knowing our furry friends will be safe.",
        "background": "This petition is about being able to buy flowers for loved ones and knowing that their furry friends are going to be safe. As an owner of 2 cats I can't get flowers as I don't know when they are safe. And many other people need to know if they are doing more harm than good for their pets.",
